  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Cost of goods sold decreased by&#160;$43.4 million from&#160;$115.7 million for the year-ended December 31, 2022&#160;to&#160;$72.3 million for the year-ended December 31, 2023&#160;primarily from reduced sales volume. The&#160;decrease in cost of goods sold was primarily attributable to a decrease of $38.4&#160;million in cost of goods sold from our organic businesses, a decrease of $3.8&#160;million from our M&amp;A businesses, and a decrease of $1.1 million in cost of goods sold from our wholesale businesses.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Gross profit increased from&#160;47.7% for the year-ended December 31, 2022 to&#160;49.3% for the year-ended December 31, 2023. The increase&#160;in gross profit was due primarily to a change of product mix, improved shipping container rates during the year ended December 31, 2023 compared to the year-ended December 31, 2022, and a reduction in liquidation of high priced excess inventory at reduced prices compared to the prior year.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b><i>Sales and Distribution Expenses</i></b></p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
