  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The decrease in research and development expenses was primarily the result of a decrease in headcount expense of $1.5&#160;million and a decrease in stock compensation expense of $0.5&#160;million, partially offset by an increase in restructuring expense of $0.5 million.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
