  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt;">The decrease in general and administrative expenses was primarily the result of&#160; a decrease of $3.7 million in professional fees, a decrease of $3.5&#160;million in depreciation and amortization, a decrease in stock compensation expense of $3.2 million, a decrease of $2.7&#160;million relating to litigation settlements,&#160;a decrease in other miscellaneous expenses of $2.3&#160;million, a decrease of $1.4 million in inventory donations, and a decrease of $1.1&#160;in headcount expense,&#160;partially offset by an increase in restructuring expense of $0.4 million. (See note 18&#160;of our Consolidated Financial Statements in this annual report on form 10-K for additional details)&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
