  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt;">The decrease in interest expense, net of&#160;$1.2 million is primarily relating to a decrease in interest expense of $0.6&#160;million due to lower average borrowings compared to the prior period&#160;and an increase in interest income of $0.6 million compared to the prior period.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
