  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The gain on extinguishment of seller note during the year-ended December 31, 2022&#160;was attributable to the settlement of the Truweo seller note, which resulted in a $2.0 million gain on extinguishment of seller note upon the extinguishment of debt.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
