   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Depreciation expense for property and equipment totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c108846184" contextRef="d_2022-01-01_2022-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">0.4</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction id="c108846185" contextRef="d_2023-01-01_2023-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">0.2</ix:nonFraction> million during the years-ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2022</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em>, respectively.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
