     <td style="width: auto;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">For each person and group<b>&#160;</b>included in this table, percentage ownership is calculated by dividing the number of shares beneficially owned by such person or group by the sum of the number of shares of common stock outstanding as of March 14, 2024, plus the number of shares of common stock that such person or group had the right to acquire within 60 days after March 14, 2024.</p> </td>
